    <h1>Which Local AI Video Generator Will <em>Actually Run</em> on Your PC?</h1>
    <p class="dek">Two completely different jobs share the name "local AI video". One needs a 24GB graphics card to make five seconds of footage. The other needs no graphics card at all and makes finished, narrated videos. Almost every guide only tells you about the first one.</p>
